  "lines": [
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a175c4c6ac79a4dbb9d24f6e6c696e65c3b9bc77ae71b6c7bba1a176b943c0b8aa41b0c8a8cfa5ceaacca658acf9aed1",
      "text": "「飄流幻境Online羅德島傳說」遊戲服務使用者合約書"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "acb0ab4fbbd9b77cadfba15da548a455c2b2bad9aef8b64faacca15ea8cfa5ce",
      "text": "為保障會員（以下簡稱消費者）使用"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a4a4b5d8baf4c073aad1a5f7a6b3adada4bda571a15da548a455c2b2bad9a5f8b77eb867c0e7aacca15e",
      "text": "中華網龍股份有限公司（以下簡稱企業經營者）"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a54eaaeda448a147a4fdab54b3d5",
      "text": "代表人：王俊博"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b971b8dca14728303229323635322d32333831",
      "text": "電話：(02)2652-2381"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b971a46cb66ca5f3a147687474703a2f2f7777772e6368696e65736567616d65722e6e65742f736572766963652e617370",
      "text": "電子郵件：http://www.chinesegamer.net/service.asp"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b56eb04fa661a77da147a578a55fa5abab6eb4e4b0cfab6eb4e4b8f4a454ac713437abd132b8b934bcd3",
      "text": "登記地址：台北市南港區南港路三段47巷2號4樓"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "baf4a77da147687474703a2f2f7777772e6368696e65736567616d65722e6e65742f",
      "text": "網址：http://www.chinesegamer.net/"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2cea440bd73b8b9a1473730353431373034",
      "text": "統一編號：70541704"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b4a3a8d1a4a7a175c4c6ac79a4dbb9d24f6e6c696e65c3b9bc77ae71b6c7bba1a176a15da548a455c2b2bad9a5bbb943c0b8a15eb943c0b8aa41b0c8aabaacdbc3f6c576af71a141bdd0a9f3b5f9a555b56eb04fa8cfa5cea5bbb943c0b8aa41b0c8ab65a141a5fda6e6",
      "text": "提供之「飄流幻境Online羅德島傳說」（以下簡稱本遊戲）遊戲服務的相關權益，請於註冊登記使用本遊戲服務前，先行"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "bc66be5ca5bbabb4acf9a454a4e9a548a457a141a641a6e6a8cfa5cea5bbaa41b0c8a143",
      "text": "審閱本契約三日以上，再行使用本服務。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a574a57ea141a5d1a9f3a6b9b342a4a7b1f8b4dac048aec9a569afe0c5dca7f3a141acb0ab4fbbd9aef8b64faaccaabac576af71a141b771bdd0a977b4c1ac64be5ca149",
      "text": "另外，由於此處之條款隨時可能變更，為保障消費者的權益，敬請定期查閱！"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2c4a440b1f8a142a650b74ea4a7aec4a44fa4cebd64b3f2",
      "text": "第一條、同意之效力及範圍"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b943c0b8aa41b0c8a4a7a5d3bdd0a141ad59aef8b64faaccacb0b54ca6e6acb0afe0a44fa448a15da670a5bcbaa1a443b7b3a4a7a5bca6a8a67ea448a15ea141c0b3a5d1a8e4aa6ba977a54eb27aa448a54eacb0a4a7a146ad59acb0adada8eea6e6acb0afe0a44fa448",
      "text": "遊戲服務之申請，若消費者為無行為能力人（如未滿七歲之未成年人），應由其法定代理人代為之；若為限制行為能力人"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a15dbaa1a443b7b3a6fda5bcbaa1a451a44bb7b3a15ea141c0b3b16faa6ba977a54eb27aa448a4a7a650b74ea143",
      "text": "（滿七歲但未滿十八歲），應得法定代理人之同意。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a5f8b77eb867c0e7aaccc0b3a9f3a978baf4adbaadb6a142b943c0b8b56ea44aadb6adb1a9cec1cab652adb6adb1a548a4a4a4e5a9fac5e3bcd0a5dca141ad59aef8b64faaccacb0adada8eea6e6acb0afe0a44fa448a9ceb54ca6e6acb0afe0a44fa448a141b0a3c0b3",
      "text": "企業經營者應於官網首頁、遊戲登入頁面或購買頁面以中文明顯標示，若消費者為限制行為能力人或無行為能力人，除應"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2c5a658a5bbb1f8ab65b6b5a4a7b357a977a57ea141a8c3c0b3a9f3aef8b64faacca4a7aa6ba977a54eb27aa448be5cc5aaa142c141b8d1a8c3a650b74ea5bbb1f8b4daa4a7a9d2a6b3a4baae65abe1a141a4e8b16fa8cfa5cea5bbb943c0b8aa41b0c8a141a5bbb1f8",
      "text": "符合本條前項之規定外，並應於消費者之法定代理人閱讀、瞭解並同意本條款之所有內容後，方得使用本遊戲服務，本條"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b4dac5dca7f3aec9a5e7a650a143",
      "text": "款變更時亦同。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "acb0ab50b669a8e0b5a3a4cea4d6a67ea8ada4dfb0b7a5feb56fae69a141a8c3ab4fbbd9a8e4acdbc3f6c576af71a141aef8b64faaccc141b8d1a5bbb4dab943c0b8a175c4c6ac79a4dbb9d24f6e6c696e65c3b9bc77ae71b6c7bba1a176c4dda9f3a175b943c0b8b36e",
      "text": "為促進兒童及少年身心健全發展，並保障其相關權益，消費者瞭解本款遊戲「飄流幻境Online羅德島傳說」屬於「遊戲軟"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "c5e9a4c0afc5badeb27abfecaa6ba176a4c0c3febcd0b7c7a455a4a7a175bbb23135afc5a176a143",
      "text": "體分級管理辦法」分類標準下之「輔15級」。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2c4a447b1f8a142a658acf9aed1be41a5cea4a7bd64b3f2",
      "text": "第二條、合約書適用之範圍"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a5f8b77eb867c0e7aaccb4a3a8d1aef8b64faacca175c4c6ac79a4dbb9d24f6e6c696e65c3b9bc77ae71b6c7bba1a176b943c0b8aa41b0c8a4cea8e4a54cacdbc3f6aa41b0c8a15da548a455c2b2bad9a5bbaa41b0c8a15ea141aef8b64faacca4cea5f8b77eb867c0e7",
      "text": "企業經營者提供消費者「飄流幻境Online羅德島傳說」遊戲服務及其他相關服務（以下簡稱本服務），消費者及企業經營"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "aaccc2f9a4e8c3f6a9f3a5bbaa41b0c8a4a7c576a751b871b0c8a141a8cca5bba658acf9b1f8b4daa4a7acf9a977a977a4a7a143",
      "text": "者雙方關於本服務之權利義務，依本合約條款之約定定之。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2c4a454b1f8a142a658acf9a4a7a4baae65",
      "text": "第三條、合約之內容"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a548a455b5f8acb0a5bba658acf9a4a7a440b3a1a4c0a141bb50a5bba658acf9b1f8b4daa8e3a6b3acdba650a4a7aec4a44fa147",
      "text": "以下視為本合約之一部分，與本合約條款具有相同之效力："
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a440a142a5f8b77eb867c0e7aacca6b3c3f6a5bbb943c0b8aa41b0c8a4a7bc73a769a9ceabc5b6c7a4baae65a143",
      "text": "一、企業經營者有關本遊戲服務之廣告或宣傳內容。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a447a142ad70b64fa8eeb943c0b8a4a7b64fb276aaeda4ceb943c0b8badeb27ab357ab68a142b357b3b9a143",
      "text": "二、計費制遊戲之費率表及遊戲管理規則、規章。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "ab65b6b5a658acf9a4baae65b1f8b4daa670a6b3bac3b871aacca141c0b3acb0aef8b64faacca6b3a751a4a7b8d1c4c0a143",
      "text": "前項合約內容條款如有疑義者，應為消費者有利之解釋。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2c4a57cb1f8a142a657b5fca977b871",
      "text": "第四條、名詞定義"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a5bba658acf9a4a7a657b5fca977b871a670a455a147",
      "text": "本合約之名詞定義如下："
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a440a142b943c0b8aa41b0c8a147ab59abfcaef8b64faaccb37ab94cbaf4bbdabaf4b8f4b373bd75b867a5d1a5f8b77eb867c0e7aacca9d2ac5bb35da4a7baf4b8f4a6f8aa41beb9a141a8cfaef8b64faaccb16fbb50a8e4a54ca4a3af53a977a4a7a668bcc6a448b16f",
      "text": "一、遊戲服務：係指消費者透過網際網路連線經由企業經營者所架設之網路伺服器，使消費者得與其他不特定之多數人得"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a650aec9b373bd75b669a6e6b943c0b8a4a7b36ec5e9a143",
      "text": "同時連線進行遊戲之軟體。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a447a142b943c0b8baf4afb8a147ab59abfca5d1a5f8b77eb867c0e7aaccacb0b4a3a8d1a5bbb943c0b8aa41b0c8a9d2abd8b86da4a7baf4afb8a143",
      "text": "二、遊戲網站：係指由企業經營者為提供本遊戲服務所建置之網站。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a454a142b943c0b8badeb27ab357ab68a147ab59abfca5d1a5f8b77eb867c0e7aaccad71a5dfa141b14da8d1acb0b357bd64b943c0b8b669a6e6a4e8a6a1a142b77cadfba6e6acb0a675ab68b5a5acdbc3f6b357ab68a143",
      "text": "三、遊戲管理規則：係指由企業經營者訂立，專供為規範遊戲進行方式、會員行為守則等相關規則。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a57ca142b943c0b8befab57ba147ab59abfca6dbaef8b64faaccb56ea44aa5bbb943c0b8b05fa6dcb56ea558a5bbb943c0b8aec9a4eea141b971b8a3a874b2ceb9efaef8b64faacca8cfa5ceb943c0b8aa41b0c8a4a7b669a6e6b94cb57ba9d2acb0a4a7acf6bffda143",
      "text": "四、遊戲歷程：係指自消費者登入本遊戲起至登出本遊戲時止，電腦系統對消費者使用遊戲服務之進行過程所為之紀錄。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a4ada142c078adc8a147ab59abfcaef8b64faaccb977a549a5f8b77eb867c0e7aacca4a7aaf7c342a9cea8e4be6cc342a143",
      "text": "五、儲值：係指消費者預付企業經營者之金額或其餘額。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a4bba142a57eb1beb57ba6a1a147ab59abfcab44a5d1a5f8b77eb867c0e7aaccb4a3a8d1a141a548bc76c554a9cea7efc5dca5f8b77eb867c0e7aaccb943c0b8aa41b0c8a4a7b942a740a142c0e7b942a142b669a6e6a4e8a6a1acb0a5d8aabaa4a7b57ba6a1a143",
      "text": "六、外掛程式：係指非由企業經營者提供，以影響或改變企業經營者遊戲服務之運作、營運、進行方式為目的之程式。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a443a142b5eac0c0aaabab7ea147ab59abfcaef8b64faaccb867a5d1b943c0b8b57ba6a1a9d2a8fab16fa4a7aaabab7ea141a55dac41a6fda4a3adada9f3aef8b64faacca548c078adc8aaf7c342a9d2c1cab652a4a7b5eac0c0b366b9f4a142a5f8b77eb867c0e7aacc",
      "text": "七、虛擬物品：係指消費者經由遊戲程式所取得之物品，包括但不限於消費者以儲值金額所購買之虛擬貨幣、企業經營者"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a74bb64fb4a3a8d1a142a9ceaef8b64faaccb669a6e6b943c0b8a4a4a4a7aca1b0caa9d2a8fab16fa4a7aaabab7ea9cec3fea6b9a6b3a751a9f3b943c0b8b669a6e6a4a7aaabab7ea143",
      "text": "免費提供、或消費者進行遊戲中之活動所取得之物品或類此有利於遊戲進行之物品。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a44ba142b943c0b8ae4da5f3a147ab59abfca8e3b3c6a544a142b0c6b57ba6a1a141a542afe0a7b9bee3b0f5a6e6b943c0b8aa41b0c8a9d2a6b3a55cafe0a4a7b36ec5e9a143",
      "text": "八、遊戲套件：係指具備主、副程式，且能完整執行遊戲服務所有功能之軟體。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a445a142a455b8fcacdbc3f6b36ec5e9a147ab59abfca5d1baf4b8f4a455b8fcb943c0b8ae4da5f3a4a7a6e6acb0a143",
      "text": "九、下載相關軟體：係指由網路下載遊戲套件之行為。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a451a142a5b2ad6ea6a8a5bba147ab59abfca5f8b77eb867c0e7aaccacb0bc69a6e6a5bba658acf9a9d2a4e4a558a4a7a6a8a5bba9cea477b5b9a549a4a9b2c4a454a448a4a7b64fa5cea143",
      "text": "十、必要成本：係指企業經營者為履行本合約所支出之成本或已給付予第三人之費用。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2c4a4adb1f8a142b943c0b8c249bcc6c078adc8",
      "text": "第五條、遊戲點數儲值"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "acb0c5fdaef8b64faaccc5e9b77ca5bbb943c0b8a4a7a5bbbde8bb50bcd6bdeca141a8c3a9f3c141b8d1a6dba8adaef8b64fbbdda844abe1a641acb0b5eac0c0aaabab7ea4a7c1cab652a141aef8b64faaccc0b3a9f3a552a5f7c0cbb5f8b943c0b8a4baae65abe1a141",
      "text": "為讓消費者體會本遊戲之本質與樂趣，並於瞭解自身消費需求後再為虛擬物品之購買，消費者應於充份檢視遊戲內容後，"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a96cb16fc078adc8a8e4a9d2abf9a6b3a4a7b943c0b8b162b8b9a141a55dac41a6fda4a3adada9f3c1cab652a5f4a6f3b5eac0c0aaabab7ea142a55cafe0a9cab944a8e3a9ceb8cbb9a2a9cab944a8e3b5a5a14320",
      "text": "始得儲值其所持有之遊戲帳號，包括但不限於購買任何虛擬物品、功能性道具或裝飾性道具等。 "
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "aef8b64faaccc1cab652a5f8b77eb867c0e7aacca4a7b943c0b8c249a142a4eba564a142b1d2b0cabd58a9ceacdbc3f6b2a3ab7ea55da440b867b67da564a8cfa5ceabe1a141a5f8b77eb867c0e7aacca759a8cca5bbaa41b0c8b1f8b4dab4a3a8d1acdbb9efc0b3a4a7",
      "text": "消費者購買企業經營者之遊戲點、月卡、啟動碼或相關產品包一經開卡使用後，企業經營者即依本服務條款提供相對應之"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "aa41b0c8a4baae65a146a477a673a44ab943c0b8b162b8b9a4a7aa41b0c8c249bcc6a141b6c8adada9f3b8d3b162b8b9a8cfa5cea141a4a3b16fc2e0c5fda4a9b2c4a454a448a143",
      "text": "服務內容；已存入遊戲帳號之服務點數，僅限於該帳號使用，不得轉讓予第三人。"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "0d",
      "text": "\r"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "b2c4a4bbb1f8a142aa41b0c8bd64b3f2",
      "text": "第六條、服務範圍"
    },
    {
      "decoded_hex": "a5bba658acf9a9d2b4a3a8d1a4a7aa41b0c8a141ab59a5d1aef8b64faacca548add3a448b971b8a3a142a6e6b0cab8cbb86da9cea8e4a54ca4e8a6a1a5cea548a455b8fca142a673a8fab943c0b8c0b3a5ceb57ba6a1a8c3b37ab94cbaf4bbdabaf4b8f4b373bd75b56e",
      "text": "本合約所提供之服務，係由消費者以個人電腦、行動裝置或其他方式用以下載、存取遊戲應用程式並透過網際網路連線登"
